OL,3,GNEWSAMan with delusional beliefs admits
OL,4,Akilling bailiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted killing a former
OL,7,Fpolice officer-turned court bailiff in
OL,8,Fa stabbing fuelled by deeply entrenched
OL,9,Fdelusional beliefs.
OL,11,FJeff Blair, 55, was stabbed while on a
OL,12,Fjob in Shildon, County Durham, on 10
OL,13,FMarch. He died later in hospital.
OL,15,FRobert Davies, 50, of Dent Street,
OL,16,FShildon, was initially charged with
OL,17,Fmurder but, after three psychiatrists
OL,18,Fagreed he had an "abnormality of mental
OL,19,Ffunctioning", prosecutors at Leeds
OL,20,FCrown Court accepted a guilty plea to
OL,21,Fmanslaughter on the grounds of
OL,22,Fdiminished responsibility.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
