OL,3,GNEWSAMan with delusional beliefs admits
OL,4,Akilling bailiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavies is currently being held at HMP
OL,7,FFrankland in Durham but will be
OL,8,Ftransferred to a secure hospital for
OL,9,Fassessments ahead of sentencing in the
OL,10,Fnew year.
